  "body": "Designed for effortless luxury and lovingly enjoyed over the past three years, this sophisticated apartment offers an inviting blend of contemporary style and everyday comfort. Generously proportioned and bathed in natural light, its desirable north-west aspect captures beautiful sunshine throughout the day, while the outlook across the orchard grove and surrounding gardens provides a peaceful green backdrop.\r\n\r\nOffering 126 sqm (approx), the thoughtfully designed floor plan features three generously proportioned double bedrooms, two stylish bathrooms, including a master ensuite, and the added convenience of a separate laundry room - a welcome touch of practicality in apartment living.\r\nAt the heart of the home, the open-plan kitchen combines premium finishes with everyday ease, featuring engineered stone benchtops, sleek cabinetry and quality, high-end appliances. Perfect for entertaining friends or enjoying a quiet evening at home, the kitchen flows seamlessly into the spacious living and dining areas, where natural light and sunshine create an inviting atmosphere. Beyond, the balcony provides a lovely place to relax, soak up the sun and enjoy the tranquil outlook.\r\n\r\nBeautifully presented and thoughtfully enhanced for comfortable living, the apartment features a calming contemporary palette, quality materials and elegant window dressings that combine shutters with soft curtains. These considered details bring texture and softness to the interiors, creating a polished yet relaxed feel throughout.\r\n\r\nEveryday living is made effortlessly convenient with two secure basement carparks, a personal storage locker and lift access that takes you directly to your floor. With everything on one level, this is apartment living at its most comfortable and considered.\r\n\r\nSet within the award-winning Kensington Park community, you'll enjoy a lifestyle that feels a little like being on holiday every day. Take a dip in the heated indoor pool, keep active in the gym, unwind in the sauna or enjoy a coffee at the on-site café. Beautifully maintained walking trails and the nearby beach, cafés and boutiques of Orewa complete the picture.\r\n\r\nLovingly enjoyed and ready for its next chapter, this is a home where thoughtful design, beautiful surroundings and an enviable lifestyle come together to create something truly special.\r\n\r\nCall Tonia Kingi today to arrange a private viewing of this stunning residence.\r\n\r\nKensington Park Realty Licensed REAA 2008.",
